g/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"damage in target\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#damageInTarget>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#wholeNumbersOnly>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"True when this game stores damage, health and armour as integers.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#wholeNumbersOnly>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"whole numbers only\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#wholeNumbersOnly>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#wholeNumbersOnly>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#defaultStaminaCost>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"What this game charges for a swing when the item never said.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#defaultStaminaCost>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"default stamina cost\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#defaultStaminaCost>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#defaultStaminaCost>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#damageReductionAtMaxArmour>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"Fraction of incoming damage removed at the top of the armour scale. With the max rating this fixes the scale as linear.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#damageReductionAtMaxArmour>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"damage reduction at max armour\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#damageReductionAtMaxArmour>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#damageReductionAtMaxArmour>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxArmourRating>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"The top of this game's armour scale.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxArmourRating>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"max armour rating\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxArmourRating>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxArmourRating>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#metresPerLengthUnit>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"metres per length unit\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#metresPerLengthUnit>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#metresPerLengthUnit>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxPlayerHealth>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"max player health\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxPlayerHealth>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxPlayerHealth>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#refillsAtCheckpoint>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"True when the item comes back full at a checkpoint. Not every game has checkpoints.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#refillsAtCheckpoint>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"refills at checkpoint\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#refillsAtCheckpoint>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#staminaCost>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"Stamina spent by one swing. Not every game has stamina.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#staminaCost>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"stamina cost\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#staminaCost>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#poise>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"Resistance to being staggered. Not every game has it.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#poise>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"poise\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#poise>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#healAmount>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"Hit points restored, in the source game's hit points.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#healAmount>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"heal amount\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#healAmount>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#armourRating>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"Protection on the source game's own armour scale.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#armourRating>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"armour rating\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#armourRating>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#length>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"Length in the source game's length unit.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#length>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"length\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#length>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#baseDamage>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"Damage of one hit, in hit points of the source game.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#baseDamage>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"base damage\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#baseDamage>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#importTarget>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#importTarget>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"The customs declaration: the receiving game states it, and the conversion rule reads it.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#importTarget>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"import target\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#importTarget>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2