om/ns/asset-passport/ga#HealingConsumable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Consumable> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#HealingConsumable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Item> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Item> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Item> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> \"Anything a player can carry from one game into another.\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Item> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"Item\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#MeleeWeapon> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#MeleeWeapon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> \"A weapon whose reach is its own length.\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#MeleeWeapon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"Melee weapon\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#MeleeWeapon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Item> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#MeleeWeapon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Weapon> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#RespawnAnchor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#RespawnAnchor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> \"An item that moves the point where a player comes back after death. It changes the rules of death in the receiving game, not only the player's power.\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#RespawnAnchor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"Respawn anchor\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#RespawnAnchor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Item> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#TwoHandedWeapon> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#TwoHandedWeapon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"Two-handed weapon\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#TwoHandedWeapon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Item> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#TwoHandedWeapon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#MeleeWeapon> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#TwoHandedWeapon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Weapon> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Weapon> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Weapon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"Weapon\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Weapon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Item> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#armourInTarget> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#armourInTarget> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"armour in target\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#armourRating> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#armourRating> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> \"Protection on the source game's own armour scale.\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#armourRating> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"armour rating\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#baseDamage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#baseDamage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> \"Damage of one hit, in hit points of the source game.\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#baseDamage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"base damage\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#damageInTarget> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#damageInTarget> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"damage in target\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#damageReductionAtMaxArmour> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#damageReductionAtMaxArmour> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> \"Fraction of incoming damage removed at the top of the armour scale. With the max rating this fixes the scale as linear.\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#damageReductionAtMaxArmour> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#damageReductionAtMaxArmour> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"damage reduction at max armour\" .\n<https://tesserac