#healInTarget> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"heal in target\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#importTarget> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#importTarget> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> \"The customs declaration: the receiving game states it, and the conversion rule reads it.\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#importTarget> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"import target\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#importTarget> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#length> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#length> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> \"Length in the source game's length unit.\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#length> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"length\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#lengthInTarget> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#lengthInTarget> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"length in target\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxArmourRating> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxArmourRating> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> \"The top of this game's armour scale.\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxArmourRating> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxArmourRating> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"max armour rating\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxPlayerHealth> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxPlayerHealth> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxPlayerHealth> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"max player health\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#metresPerLengthUnit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#metresPerLengthUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#metresPerLengthUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"metres per length unit\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#poise> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#poise> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> \"Resistance to being staggered. Not every game has it.\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#poise> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"poise\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#refillsAtCheckpoint> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#refillsAtCheckpoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> \"True when the item comes back full at a checkpoint. Not every game has checkpoints.\" .\n<h